  "description_short": "Modern eatery in George's Outeniqua Village serving breakfast, lunch and cocktails in a relaxed atmosphere.",
  "description_long": "Bossa George brings a laid-back vibe to Outeniqua Village, where the focus is on good times and honest food. The menu covers all bases from hearty breakfasts to proper lunches, with a cocktail bar that keeps things interesting. It's the kind of spot where locals meet for coffee in the morning and settle in for sundowners later.\n\nThe setting is casual and comfortable, perfect for catching up with friends or fuelling up between errands. Located at the corner of the N9 and Saint George's Road, it's easily accessible whether you're a George resident or passing through. With a solid reputation for consistency and a menu that doesn't try too hard, Bossa delivers exactly what you'd hope for in a neighbourhood eatery.\n\nExpect friendly service, decent portions, and a relaxed approach to dining that reflects the Garden Route lifestyle. It's not fancy, and it doesn't need to be — just a reliable spot for a good meal in comfortable surroundings.",
